    {
      "source": "Return the native response of the underlying server API, if possible,\nalso unwrapping <a href=\"ServerHttpResponseDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponseDecorator</code></a> if necessary.",
      "translation": "返回底层服务器 API 的原生响应（如果可能），并在必要时解除<a href=\"ServerHttpResponseDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponseDecorator</code></a>的包装。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a <code>Mono</code> that indicates completion or error",
      "translation": "一个指示完成或错误的<code>Mono</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> of <code>Publishers</code> to write the body\nof the HttpOutputMessage to the underlying HTTP layer, flushing after\neach <code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>.",
      "translation": "使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>` 的 `<code>Publishers</code>` 来将 `HttpOutputMessage` 的主体写入底层 HTTP 层，并在每个 `<code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>` 之后刷新。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Wraps another <a href=\"ServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponse</code></a> and delegates all methods to it.\nSubclasses can override specific methods selectively.",
      "translation": "封装另一个 `<a href=\"ServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponse</code></a>` 并将其所有方法委托给它。子类可以选择性地重写特定方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a> that can be used to create the body.",
      "translation": "返回一个可用于创建主体的<a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> to write the body of the message to the\nunderlying HTTP layer.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> 将消息体写入底层 HTTP 层。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <code>ResponseCookie</code>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<code>ResponseCookie</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a mutable map with the cookies to send to the server.",
      "translation": "返回一个可变映射，其中包含要发送到服务器的 Cookie。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the headers of this message.",
      "translation": "返回此消息的标题。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the HttpOutputMessage is committed.",
      "translation": "HttpOutputMessage 是否已提交。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the HTTP status code to the given value as an integer.",
      "translation": "将 HTTP 状态码设置为给定的整数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the HTTP status code of the response.",
      "translation": "设置响应的 HTTP 状态码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>false</code> if the status code change wasn't processed because\nthe HTTP response is committed, <code>true</code> if successfully set.",
      "translation": "如果状态码更改未处理（因为 HTTP 响应已提交），则为 `<code>false</code>`；如果成功设置，则为 `<code>true</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"getNativeResponse(org.springframework.http.server.reactive.ServerHttpResponse)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the expected native response type</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"getNativeResponse(org.springframework.http.server.reactive.ServerHttpResponse)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 预期的原生响应类型</span>",
      "count": 2
