    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the native response can't be obtained",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果无法获取本机响应",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>body</code> - the body content publisher",
      "translation": "<code>body</code> - 正文内容发布器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>response</code> - the response to check",
      "translation": "<code>response</code> - 要检查的响应",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> the supplied action must be properly deferred,\nfor example, via <code>Mono.defer(Supplier)</code> or <code>Mono.fromRunnable(Runnable)</code>, to ensure it's\nexecuted in the right order, relative to other actions.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 提供的操作必须正确延迟，例如通过 <code>Mono.defer(Supplier)</code> 或 <code>Mono.fromRunnable(Runnable)</code>，以确保其相对于其他操作的执行顺序正确。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This method should be automatically invoked at the end of message\nprocessing so typically applications should not have to invoke it.\nIf invoked multiple times it should have no side effects.",
      "translation": "此方法应在消息处理结束时自动调用，因此通常应用程序无需手动调用它。如果多次调用，不应产生任何副作用。",
      "count": 1
    },
